# soroban-sdk writes a JSON snapshot of the end-state Env for every #[test]
# that constructs an Env. They are large, regenerate on every run, and nothing
# here reviews them as golden files — so they only ever show up as noise in
# `git status`. Delete this rule if snapshot diffing is ever wired into review.
test_snapshots/
